<title>UK: Timah at 11.925 in London at 0823 GMT.</title>
<headline>Timah at 11.925 in London at 0823 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah was traded at $11.925 per GDR in London on Tuesday at around 0823 GMT.</p>
<p>It recorded a low of $11.925 and a high of $12.125.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Monday was $11.7. One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
